Hi all,
	Its a source in c++ in development of hack-related game with
	graphic interface of the Xwindows, supporting about 16 users
	over the internet simultaniously.  

	We spent nine months of programming on unix with the g++ compiler
	and want to know if anyone is interested in our work (we plan
	to spread the game world wide in the future). 
	If you are interested, please email us. We want to know how
	many people are interested, and it would encourage us to
	continue on this huge scale project.
	
	We are also looking for people who are interested in helping us 
	with advices, code writing, comments, etc.

	We, Dror Shaharabany, Eetay Natan, Eyal Melamed and Saffi Hartal,
 	from Isreal (along with Chris Hore from Australia) started
	this project as a workshop in Object Oriented Programming,
	the project was very successful and we were granted an account
	to complete the game. 

